
 !Example JETSPIN input file 9: 1000-bead CPU/GPU performance benchmark
 !Derived from Test Case 7, without evaporation or rotating electric field.

 system 3
 integrator 3

 !Exactly 1,000 short integration steps for the benchmark.
 timestep 1.d-8
 final time 1.d-5
 print time 2.d-6
 seed 317

 print list t x yz n rc
 printstat list t x y z vx vy vz st n rc curn curc nref

 multiple step no
 dynamic refinement no

 airdrag yes
 airdrag airdensity     0.00121d0
 airdrag airviscosity   0.1511d0
 airdrag airvelocity    0.d0

 !Keep the initial 1000-bead workload fixed during the benchmark.
 inserting no
 removing no
 gravity yes

 !Uniform initial discretization from nozzle (x=0) to collector (x=16 cm).
 points 1000
 initial length 16.d0                       !cm
 nozzle velocity 0.282942121d0              !cm/s
 nozzle stress 0.d0                         !g cm-1 s-2
 yield stress 0.d0                          !g cm-1 s-2
 nozzle cross 0.005d0                       !cm
 density mass 0.839253525d0                 !g cm-3
 density charge 44000.0d0                   !g1/2 cm-3/2 s-1
 viscosity 20.d0                            !g cm-1 s-1
 elastic modulus 50000.d0                   !g cm-1 s-2
 collector distance 16.d0                   !cm
 surface tension 21.133d0                   !g s-2

 perturbation yes
 perturbation frequency 1.d4                !s^-1
 perturbation amplitude 1.d-3               !cm

 !Constant axial electric potential; no rotating/orthogonal field.
 external potential 30.02076857d0            !g1/2 cm1/2 s-1

 evaporation no

 Finish
